OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of birds to be culled
OL,4,Aamid flu outbreak
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 2,000 birds have died and
OL,7,Fthousands more are to be euthanised at
OL,8,Fa large poultry farm which has been
OL,9,Fimpacted by bird flu.
OL,11,FThe Department for Environment, Farming
OL,12,Fand Rural Affairs (Defra) confirmed the
OL,13,Fdisease was found at a commercial
OL,14,Ffacility near Belford, in north
OL,15,FNorthumberland.
OL,17,FIt declared a 1.9 mile (3km) protection
OL,18,Fzone and 6.2 mile (10km) surveillance
OL,19,Fzone around the premises. The latter
OL,20,Fincludes the Farne Islands, which are
OL,21,Ffamous for their marine bird life.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
