OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of birds to be culled
OL,4,Aamid flu outbreak
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthumberland County Councillor Guy
OL,7,FRenner-Thompson said 29,000 birds would
OL,8,Fhave to be culled at the farm where the
OL,9,Foutbreak was identified.
